@startuml
title CV 领域逻辑实体图
hide methods
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false

class CVDocument <<AggregateRoot>> {
  documentId
  originalFileRef
  mediaType
  fileHash
  createdAt
}

class CVVersion {
  versionId
  parentVersionId
  versionNumber
  extractedText
  confirmedText
  extractionStatus
  versionStatus
  textSource
  createdAt
  confirmedAt
}

class CVReview {
  reviewId
  reviewType
  jobId
  jobDescriptionSnapshotRef
  ruleVersion
  promptVersion
  status
  createdAt
}

class CVSuggestion {
  suggestionId
  targetText
  targetLocation
  issue
  rationale
  proposedText
  origin
  factCheckStatus
  decision
  decidedAt
}

class AppliedSuggestion {
  versionId
  suggestionId
  appliedOrder
}

class AIConsent <<GlobalRegistryProjection>> {
  consentId
  dataCategory
  scopeVersion
  status
  grantedAt
  revokedAt
}

class AIInvocation {
  invocationId
  provider
  model
  inputVersionRefs
  promptVersion
  cacheKey
  cacheStatus
  costMetadata
  outputRef
  status
}

class SensitiveDeletionAudit {
  auditId
  eventType
  opaqueObjectToken
  deletedCounts
  result
  occurredAt
}

enum ReviewType {
  GENERIC_HEALTH
  TAILORED_TO_JOB
}

enum SuggestionDecision {
  UNDECIDED
  ACCEPTED
  REJECTED
  DEFERRED
}

CVDocument "1" *-- "1..*" CVVersion : 拥有
CVVersion "0..1 父" <-- "0..* 子" CVVersion : 派生
CVVersion "1 输入" <-- "0..*" CVReview : 固定引用
CVReview "1" *-- "0..*" CVSuggestion : 产生
CVVersion "1 派生版本" -- "0..*" AppliedSuggestion
CVSuggestion "1" -- "0..1" AppliedSuggestion
CVReview "1" *-- "0..*" AIInvocation : 执行/重试
AIConsent ..> AIInvocation : 全局注册表按类别授权
CVReview ..> ReviewType
CVSuggestion ..> SuggestionDecision

note right of CVVersion
CONFIRMED 后不可原地修改；
派生必须创建新版本
end note

note bottom of CVSuggestion
FACT_CONFLICT 不可接受；
决定只能由用户作出
end note

note bottom of AIConsent
全局 ai-consent.md 的域内投影；
非独立长期副本
end note

note bottom of SensitiveDeletionAudit
删除后唯一保留记录；
不得含文件名、正文、提示或输出
end note
@enduml
